## 4. Gate 1 Expandido: `parse_number` com Valores Não-Exatos & Limites

| Entrada | Valor Decimal | Cálculo Canônico Q32.32 (Trunc toward zero) | Valor Bruto Q32.32 (`raw`) | Status Code | Status Name | Cursor | Próx Char |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `"0"` | `0.0` | $0 \times 2^{32}$ | `0` | `0` | `OK` | 1 | `\0` |
| `"42"` | `42.0` | $42 \times 2^{32}$ | `180388626432` | `0` | `OK` | 2 | `\0` |
| `".5"` | `0.5` | $1 \times 2^{32} / 2$ | `2147483648` | `0` | `OK` | 2 | `\0` |
| `"3.125"` | `3.125` | $3125 \times 2^{32} / 1000$ | `13421772800` | `0` | `OK` | 5 | `\0` |
| `"0.1"` | `0.1` | $\lfloor 1 \times 2^{32} / 10 \rfloor$ | `429496729` | `0` | `OK` | 3 | `\0` |
| `"-0.1"` | `-0.1` | $\text{trunc}( -1 \times 2^{32} / 10 )$ | `-429496729` | `0` | `OK` | 4 | `\0` |
| `"1e-10"` | `0.0000000001` | $\lfloor 1 \times 2^{32} / 10^{10} \rfloor = \lfloor 0.429496... \rfloor$ | `0` | `0` | `OK (UNDERFLOW_ZERO)` | 5 | `\0` |
| `"999999999999"` | $10^{12} - 1$ | $999999999999 \times 2^{32} > 2^{63}-1$ | `-9003` | `-9003` | `ERR_OVERFLOW` | 12 | `\0` |
| `"1.25e2"` | `125.0` | $125 \times 2^{32}$ | `536870912000` | `0` | `OK` | 6 | `\0` |
| `"0x10"` | `16.0` | $16 \times 2^{32}$ | `68719476736` | `0` | `OK` | 4 | `\0` |
| `"1e"` | `1.0` | $1 \times 2^{32}$ (deixa 'e') | `4294967296` | `0` | `OK` | 1 | `'e'` |
| `"."` | `0.0` | Rejeição sem dígitos | `-9005` | `-9005` | `ERR_INVALID_NUMBER` | 0 | `.` |

